{"id": "feedback_run_01", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 1, "source_run_id": "20261005T015935_515397Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "1. trading starting relic for boss relic for neow's blessing is always the best option, second best would be next 3 combats enemies start at 1hp\r\n2. need to establish a deck u want to play, usually based off the first few card selection options, either fire breathing status deck, rupture self damage for strength deck or exhaust decks.\r\n3. managing hp during combat is important\r\n4. slaver's collar was better than tiny house for first act boss relic reward", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_01_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T02:43:35.039457+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_02", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 2, "source_run_id": "20261005T024342_112321Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "APPROVE_INITIAL", "human_feedback": "", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_02_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T03:08:44.482618+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_03", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 3, "source_run_id": "20261005T030855_855448Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "need to plan ur routes properly as u progress through the act, also need to calculate damage taken vs damage dealt in combats, minimize damage taken and maximise damage dealt in combat, and also taking into account debuffs u can apply to enemies", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_03_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T04:16:51.991832+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_04", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 4, "source_run_id": "20261005T041700_184304Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "you need to establish a deck combo, and skip card rewards if they do not fit the deck.\r\nmanaging hp is crucial in the runs\r\npotions should be used if they help to minimise damage taken", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_04_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T04:48:03.518846+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_05", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 5, "source_run_id": "20261005T044811_483994Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "never take coffee dripper as a reward boss relic. need to skip cards if they do not contribute to the deck build.", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_05_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T05:41:17.966163+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_06", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 6, "source_run_id": "20261005T054124_187380Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "APPROVE_INITIAL", "human_feedback": "", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_06_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T07:00:31.319207+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_07", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 7, "source_run_id": "20261005T070043_042121Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "if u play corruption, do not waste skills when you have sufficient block to not take any damage. \r\nbesides that, managing hp well during combat is what you are missing, and misplaying damage cards on wrong enemies\r\ndeck building is ok this run, just need more cards that combo well with fire breathing", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_07_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T08:09:25.711000+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_08", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 8, "source_run_id": "20261005T080931_438855Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "APPROVE_INITIAL", "human_feedback": "", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_08_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T08:45:08.972041+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_09", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 9, "source_run_id": "20261005T084526_450252Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "stop adding so many redundant cards into deck, if the card rewards do not add anything to the build, just skip the cards. \r\ntry to remove strikes and defends as u go, if u have no curses in the deck.\r\nmanage hp during combat better, play it smart. \r\nhave a build in mind during the first act and play to its strengths", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_09_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T09:22:03.831346+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_10", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 10, "source_run_id": "20261005T092211_967399Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "1. yes you should heal when low hp\r\n2. take fire breathing, but subsequent card rewards find cards that put status cards in ur deck or other status akin combo cards\r\n3. manage hp and block better in combat", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_10_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T09:58:12.447293+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_11", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 11, "source_run_id": "20261005T095820_048905Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "APPROVE_INITIAL", "human_feedback": "", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_11_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T11:42:08.599023+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_12", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 12, "source_run_id": "20261005T114227_658860Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "keep your deck at around 20ish cards, anything more than 25 cards is considered too many cards. stick to a deck build and commit to it, and skip cards that do not contribute to the build", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_12_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T12:47:51.094601+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_13", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 13, "source_run_id": "20261005T124756_984830Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "try not to have both fire breathing and rupture in the same deck, you usually pick one and go the build for that specific power. \r\nversus the centurion and mystic in particular, u aim the centurion instead of the mystic first.\r\ntry to save hp as much as u can during combat", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_13_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T13:13:55.088655+00:00"}
{"id": "feedback_run_14", "source": "human_trajectory_feedback", "source_run": 14, "source_run_id": "20261005T131402_018421Z", "review_version": "trajectory-feedback-v2", "teaching_policy_version": "authoritative-human-teaching-v1", "review_decision": "HUMAN_TEACHING", "human_feedback": "do not take bites for max hp unless u have blood vial to trigger the special event. beisdes that ur lessons are fine", "packet_file": "C:\\Users\\Yusia\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\Codebases\\sts-llm-fyp\\reflection\\condition_c2_outputs\\run_14_feedback_review.json", "stored_at": "2026-10-05T13:54:50.749826+00:00"}
